{"4608380":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Joy Malignant","steam_appid":4608380,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joy Malignant is a short, surreal dice-based RPG where your past is a tool. In a cursed city filled with suffering, your past shapes your skills and your appearance. Survive the city's hellish trials, meet tortured characters, and develop your own unique indentity. Every choice matters as your actions will literally shape you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/0c84aa5be67eae429991ecd3e8206e1a.poster.avif?t=1785338835\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/0c84aa5be67eae429991ecd3e8206e1a.webm?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/0c84aa5be67eae429991ecd3e8206e1a.mp4?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everyone wears their past on their sleeve. Except you.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Visceria, your appearance is shaped by your past. As a faceless, your past has been erased. Through surviving in this hellish city, you will meet characters and  make choices that will shape you, developing your personality, appearance, and abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/96888be001962702c3d033c42cdd7c84.poster.avif?t=1785338835\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/96888be001962702c3d033c42cdd7c84.webm?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/96888be001962702c3d033c42cdd7c84.mp4?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dice Based Dread<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources, use dice to perform actions, and play to your personality's strengths to survive in the city. Do what you must to survive, and try not to lose yourself in the process.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/12314e2774659708299f7e6aba61761e.poster.avif?t=1785338835\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/12314e2774659708299f7e6aba61761e.webm?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/12314e2774659708299f7e6aba61761e.mp4?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mosaics of Suffering<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's appearance is shaped by their past. Meet tortured characters and analyze their history by seeing their Mosaic, then use it to your advantage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/8a937459a14af4d671e56a3b50aec0be.poster.avif?t=1785338835\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/8a937459a14af4d671e56a3b50aec0be.webm?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/8a937459a14af4d671e56a3b50aec0be.mp4?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Shape You<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mosaic starts out empty, then is shaped by your experiences. As you make choices, you will gain more parts of yourself. This will afffect your stats and abilities, as well as your appearance. Be careful, you can't change the past after its happened!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/cfb243c2000e067658cb6eae8d912b77.poster.avif?t=1785338835\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/cfb243c2000e067658cb6eae8d912b77.webm?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/cfb243c2000e067658cb6eae8d912b77.mp4?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Museum Of Agony<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life in Visceria is twisted and painful, especially for a faceless like you. Try to hold onto your sanity while frequenting dirty ruins, slaughterhouses, decrepit bars, bloody hospitals, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/0f01f3e48e5818399583a0487f2c8bed.poster.avif?t=1785338835\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608380\/extras\/0f01f3e48e5818399583a0487f2c8bed.webm?t=1785338835\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstati